@startuml pool-creation
skinparamlocked dpiCommandLine 200
title Pool creation

<style>
activityDiagram {
  FontName Inter
  FontSize 13
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  activity {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #64748B
    LineThickness 1
    RoundCorner 6
    FontColor #0F172A
    Padding 8
    Margin 7
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #64748B
    LineThickness 1.2
    FontColor #4A5A6A
    FontSize 11
  }
  swimlane {
    LineColor #CBD5E1
    LineThickness 1
    FontColor #334155
    FontStyle bold
  }
  circle {
    BackgroundColor #334155
    LineColor #334155
  }
  note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #CBD5E1
    FontColor #475569
    FontSize 11
  }
  .created {
    BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
    LineColor #34D399
    FontColor #065F46
  }
}
</style>

|#F5F3FF|venueOperator\nParty|
|#F8FAFC|dvo\nParty|
|#EFF6FF|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|

|venueOperator\nParty|
start
:Exercise **PoolFactory_ProposePool**\non **PoolFactory**;
|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Create pending **PoolProposal**; <<created>>
if (Awaiting approval\nFirst confirmed action?) then (withdraw)
  group Optional withdrawal\nWhile pending — before dvo accepts or rejects {
    |venueOperator\nParty|
    :Exercise **PoolProposal_Withdraw**\non pending **PoolProposal**;
    |DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
    :Archive pending **PoolProposal**;
    stop
  }
else (dvo decision)
endif
|dvo\nParty|
if (Accept proposal?) then (yes)
  :Exercise **PoolProposal_Accept**\non **PoolProposal**\nwith initial ratio (quote / base);
  |DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
  :Archive pending **PoolProposal**;
  :Create accepted **PoolProposal**; <<created>>
  :Exercise **PoolFactory_CreatePool**\non **PoolFactory**\n(dvo + venueOperator);
  :Archive accepted **PoolProposal**;
  :Create **Pool**\nwith token factories + reserve accounts; <<created>>
  :Create **PoolConfig**\nwith fee + initial ratio; <<created>>
  :Create **PoolState**\nwith reserves + LP supply = 0; <<created>>
  stop
else (no)
  |dvo\nParty|
  :Exercise **PoolProposal_Reject**\non **PoolProposal**;
  |DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
  :Archive **PoolProposal**;
  stop
endif

@enduml
